error[E0145]: 'jsonDecode' cannot decode into 'Plain': it does not carry '@json'
  --> check_json_decode_generic_recv.bit:28:12
   |
28 |     return jsonDecode<T>(j)?
   |            ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ mark 'Plain' with '@json' — a generic that calls 'jsonDecode<T>' decodes only into a class that opted in, exactly as a direct call does
